  <item>
    <title>没有明天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c5308fb0167b8db91b499d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c5308fb0167b8db91b499d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 11:25:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年妇女节，值得庆祝的是，这个节日终于找回了原本的名字。《还有明天》上映前夕，让我们来回顾一下去年的好东西吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>导引：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 一片石斑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 觉醒了，然后呢？——那些关于《好东西》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 我们只是不同，生来不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 来自已婚妇女的疑惑：当代饮食男女怎么就看对眼了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 他就是贱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 小孩就是小孩啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 女儿会继承妈妈的阅读习惯、写作天赋、穿衣品味···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 我不再相信“明天会更好”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 三月是女性的春节档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> 孤独是永恒的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 独自努力是你做过且唯一能做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 作为一个直女打量“他者"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> 我的厌女时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3078">51:18</a> 贫穷、咳嗽和爱，我讨厌第一个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3277">54:37</a> 思想验证区域里，人生并没有说服力</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>滥俗的歌-汉堡黄</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/630c21973887b85de4623ad2/lu0-ZgArvhSoAT6ifzB6TTG4-pPZ.m4a" length="62866343" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>一个绝望直女的独白</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673a0534f373fe5d4d0154f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673a0534f373fe5d4d0154f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Nov 2024 00:23:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>那些微妙而不可言说的…</span></p><p><span>导引：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> “人是雌雄同体的”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 当我和异性朋友谈及女性主义···</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> “它只是块脆弱的肉！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 当男性感受到男凝···</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 为什么总是女性在牺牲？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 女性主义终于内化为我的本能</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 资本主义的剥削vs父权制的压迫，or与人建立真正的联结</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 生理上不喜欢女的，心理上不接受男的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 我不喜欢你，但我希望你好、</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 我与我周旋久</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 被推上竞技场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> “被看见”好难啊</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>到不了的季节-黄子弘凡</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq0xTIPvIqldGW6lHLIeLTpbNFv0.m4a" length="39475487" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>二零年代综合征</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d186db93c4381623b963fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d186db93c4381623b963fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Aug 2024 08:46:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>二十岁是这样的年纪，伴随着大量信息涌入的迷茫、看到同辈都在前进而自己止步不前的不安、还有仍旧想改变世界的理想主义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>导引：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 他们好像知道又不完全明白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 我的人生电影《云图》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 克隆人≈白丁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> They feed us to ourselves</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 为什么我们想要长大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 偶尔会想过失败者的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 托关系找了份实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> 一些个小确幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> “哒哒”替代“刷刷”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 在上海差点没赶上回家的最后一班火车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 被拉入竞技场的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 那些弄丢的春夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏日离别练习-蒲熠星</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm2P88P2z7M9T1fKqXcMsF86GbM1.m4a" length="26131238" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>当海风拂过雪山顶</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d6f3043af97665af2a88ce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d6f3043af97665af2a88ce</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Feb 2024 07:08:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年年末，我去到威海；今年年初，朋友直抵拉萨。疫情之后，我们一直在路上，不论是孤身一人还是双人成行，新的旅途总有新的故事···</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxdvR1gL-QkDpMayexCs8NdLx8Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>日照金山的背面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foz7bZxcTBUznErvCAS32a3Gi5Lh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>新年的第一缕日出</span></p><span></span><h2><span>导引：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 去追日出吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 高反如期而至</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 偶遇日照金山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 蹦高原迪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 剧本杀一样的车祸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a> 来自天上邮局的信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 第一缕阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 沉船出人意料的巨大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> “老妹儿，干活了快点”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1217">20:17</a> 2024的第一个日出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 会羡慕吗？会，但不多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 从一个地点到另一个，用走的，别跳</span></p><span></span><h2><span>BGM：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>nightfall-aren park</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stay Alive-José González</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luam8_1lzyiL6dhJ5Il7BuwLPiYq.m4a" length="37172483" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>糟糕，我陷入循环了···</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e33ffd80c9ec4c5fe01313</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e33ffd80c9ec4c5fe01313</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Aug 2023 10:44:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈哈，有没有被标题骗到呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>从《古相思曲》到《你一生的故事》，人类总在试图逃离时间的桎梏，迄今并未成功。达摩克利之剑从未落下，对其的恐惧也从未停止。那些无解的命题，我的答案是——不知道。</span></p><span></span><p><span>导引：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">1:33</a> 心如死水的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 相遇即诀别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">9:12</a> 不同语言造就的文明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">9:47</a> 费玛尔最少时间定律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 命运的齿轮开始转动···</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> “反抗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 子弹正中眉心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 我回到过去杀死了我的祖父</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> 已知了结局你还愿意踏出这一步吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a> 人无法在青春时怀有对青春的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 幼年时对死亡的恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>日暮里-诩柒七</span></p><span></span><p><span>相思不言-曾文力</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmrPupUEKz6gHkCvhDGm-DyxM2KY.m4a" length="28684613" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>机器人有人心吗？人呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64089c0f8be5d40013a0a539</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64089c0f8be5d40013a0a539</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Mar 2023 14:30:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目就《克拉拉与太阳》展开探讨，包括但不限于机器人、人类与人心的关系，人心的本质等内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>导引：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 联结才是人心之复杂所在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 非典型intp，爱吃薯条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 播客=赚钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 我也是精英中的一员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> &nbsp;每个人都在逐渐成为鲁迅笔下的看客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> 机器人是更好的选择吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> 机器人不需要人心吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>In Ordina-Tristan Eckerson</span></p><span></span><p><span>Malleable Beings-The Paper Kites</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnYfgwIc0v8kDfSJJVqqHd8vBq-n.m4a" length="18236100" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>过往是线与线交织缠绕的藤蔓</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e35dcbcbcaa6132deb6a34</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e35dcbcbcaa6132deb6a34</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 08:31:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每时每刻都有无数南辕北辙的想法，丢掉太过可惜，又无从串联形成逻辑链。</span><br><span>而前段时间一些顿悟的瞬间让我找到了一条逻辑链：过往是线与线交织缠绕的藤蔓。</span></p><p><span>导引：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 未被社会这个大熔炉消磨过的少年意气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">4:47</a> 巨人千千万</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">7:07</a> 我们棋逢对手，惺惺相惜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">8:43</a> 从茎叶变成盘根错节的藤蔓</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span><br><span>日暮里</span><br><span>狼人游戏</span><br><span>所念皆星河</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpE2ybJPnFzXiw5X1CL-efLnFUjp.m4a" length="13190090" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3uBjuUIQ76O-zCE3b5xgvi8EBG.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
